{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55768","headline":"题枯木庵（题拟） · 义存","name":"题枯木庵（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庵前永日无狼子，磨下终年绝雀儿。\n（按：原题作：「师在枯木庵坐禅，於水磨坊前晒麦，乃亲题云。\n」句後云：「山中至今并无狼虎，凡于磨坊前晒麦，亦无鸟雀，皆如师言。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"义存","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55768.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55768","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}